    "body": "> I don’t recall what that old search feature did/does, but as far as I know it only worked for searching within the current page?\r\n\r\nNo, it was more along the lines of what I've envisioned in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2565#issuecomment-296323896 (\"my alternate approach\"). Try it out at https://developers.whatwg.org/. That's still the direction I think would be best for #2565, instead of full-text search with an overlay...\r\n\r\n> The old version also has inlined references\r\n\r\nYeah, I somehow forgot that. I think it's quite nice, although it needs Wattsi support.\r\n\r\nLet me reorganize the OP to mark things that need Wattsi support. Then maybe people could help with them?",
